  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.rennet": "Rennet is a liquid ingredient used in cheese making. Bottles contain 250 mB and buckets 1,000 mB; both can transfer into Barrels and cauldrons. It is not placeable in the world.",
  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.apple_cider_vinegar": "Apple juice ferments into apple cider vinegar after 12,000 ticks without a culture. You can also ferment cider into vinegar. To make cider directly from apple juice, add a wine culture to the left tank first.",
