  "jei.italiansdelight.fluids.grape_juice": "Crush red grape bunches in the Crushing Tub for 250 mB of red grape juice and red grape seeds per bunch. Collect with bottles (250 mB) or buckets (1,000 mB) and store in barrels or cauldrons.\n\nThis is the existing juice used by the wine brewing barrel. White grape juice is now a different fluid and cannot mix with red juice. Bottled juice is not yet drinkable.",
